          "correct": true
        },
        {
          "text": "$-15$",
          "why": "Computed $(-3)^{2} = -9$ so $g(-3) = -5$, then $f(-5) = -15$."
        },
        {
          "text": "$125$",
          "why": "Evaluated $g(f(-3))$ instead of $f(g(-3))$."
        },
